@startuml GasArchitecture
' AesirWarden · current GAS source and asset mapping · 2026-09-29
title AesirWarden - GAS 与 Boss 动作边界
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAF7
left to right direction

component "BT / 冻结 PPO\n高层动作" as Policy
component "UAesirBossActionComponent\n校验与 Action→Ability" as Action
component "UAesirAbilitySystemComponent" as ASC
component "GameplayAbility\nGA_Boss_* / GA_Player_Guard" as GA
component "GameplayEffect\n伤害/冷却/状态" as GE
component "UAesirAttributeSet\nHealth/MaxHealth/Damage" as Core
component "UAesirPlayerAttributeSet\nGuard/战斗派生值" as Player
component "Boss Telemetry" as Tel

Policy --> Action : EAesirBossAction
Action --> ASC : CanActivate / TryActivate
ASC --> GA : 激活
GA --> GE : 应用效果
GE --> Core : 修改核心属性
GE --> Player : 修改玩家属性
Action --> Tel : Accepted / typed 拒绝
Core --> Tel : 伤害与终局
note bottom of Action
  Accepted 只表示能力启动，
  不等于命中或动作完成。
end note
@enduml
